  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.13: A source-provenance release for editor integration (metadata only — rendered output unchanged). #46: ParseResult.LineOrigins and TryGetLineOrigin map each line of the fully-expanded document back to the file and line the author edits, via a new LineOrigin(SourceFile, SourceLine, IsSynthetic) type; the mapping is produced by the parser and stays correct through include:: expansion (incl. tags=/lines=/leveloffset= filtering and nesting), conditional (ifdef/ifeval) stripping, and front-matter removal. #45: table cells now carry their own per-cell source span (TableCellNode/TableCellLayout.Source) instead of the whole row's range, inline ranges inside cells are absolute document coordinates, and multi-line a| cells carry an absolute range with absolute-numbered nested children. See CHANGELOG.md.",
